#==============================================================================================
#
#   navigation_current_entry_change_event - HTML::NavigationCurrentEntryChangeEvent, the
#   currententrychange event of the navigation API
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/NavigationCurrentEntryChangeEvent.cpp (lines 1-44) and the
#       accessors of NavigationCurrentEntryChangeEvent.h. Navigation fires it at a same-document
#       navigation (a fragment link, a history traversal within the document); nobody listens
#       before scripting, but the event is made and dispatched as in the donor.
